{"id":"d17e47b17e07be78","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Iteration Tree","display":"df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree — ZFC Inner2 Iteration Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree — ZFC Inner2 Iteration Tree","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree — ZFC Inner2 Iteration Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is the metasyntactic predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (metasyntactic existential closure defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This closure inherits the metasyntactic status of the registered iteration-tree predicate; it is not promoted to a ZFC-internal definition merely by existentially binding the length.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is the metasyntactic predicate from [[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner2IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1158,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-290","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree.md|58-df-zfc-inner2-iteration-tree]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","92fbda0605a6cb98"]}